 {
  "id": "gre_v6_in_v6",
  "proto": "gre",
  "summary": "v6-in-v6 纯 v6 隧道（T-GRE-5）：外层 IPv6(next header 47) + GRE proto 0x86dd + 内层 IPv6/UDP/DNS -> 1 帧",
  "spec_json": {
   "layers": [
    {
     "ip": {
      "src": "fd00::1",
      "dst": "fd00::2"
     }
    },
    {
     "gre": {}
    },
    {
     "ip": {
      "src": "fd01::1",
      "dst": "fd01::2"
     }
    },
    {
     "udp": {
      "src_port": 12345,
      "dst_port": 80
     }
    },
    {
     "dns": {
      "query_only": true
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "expect": {
   "min_packets": 1,
   "fields": [
    {
     "packet": 1,
     "field": "gre.proto",
     "value": "0x86dd"
    },
    {
     "packet": 1,
     "field": "gre.flags_and_version",
     "value": "0x0000"
    },
    {
     "packet": 1,
     "field": "eth.type",
     "value": "0x86dd"
    },
    {
     "packet": 1,
     "field": "udp.srcport",
     "value": "12345"
    },
    {
     "packet": 1,
     "field": "udp.dstport",
     "value": "80"
    },
    {
     "packet": 1,
     "field": "ipv6.version",
     "value": "6,6"
    },
    {
     "packet": 1,
     "field": "ipv6.src",
     "value": "fd00::1,fd01::1"
    }
   ],
   "notes": [
    "T-GRE-5【D-GRE-2 §4】：外层 eth.type=0x86dd（IPv6 承载 GRE），GRE proto=0x86dd（v6 内层），内层 UDP 校验和非零（RFC 6936）；内层 ipv6 字段断言跑完落盘 pcap 校准后回钉"
   ],
   "frames": [
    {
     "packet": 1,
     "offset": 58,
     "hex": "60 00 00 00"
    },
    {
     "packet": 1,
     "offset": 98,
     "hex": "30 39 00 50"
    }
   ]
  }
 },
