 {
  "id": "gre_sequence_multi",
  "proto": "gre",
  "summary": "sequence 多帧递增（T-GRE-8）：内层 [tcp,http] 9 帧（3握手+2数据+4挥手），S 位置位逐帧序号 0→8",
  "spec_json": {
   "layers": [
    {
     "ip": {
      "src": "10.0.0.1",
      "dst": "20.0.0.1"
     }
    },
    {
     "gre": {
      "sequence": true
     }
    },
    {
     "ip": {
      "src": "192.168.1.1",
      "dst": "192.168.1.2"
     }
    },
    {
     "tcp": {
      "src_port": 12345,
      "dst_port": 80
     }
    },
    {
     "http": {}
    }
   ]
  },
  "expect": {
   "min_packets": 9,
   "fields": [
    {
     "packet": 1,
     "field": "gre.flags_and_version",
     "value": "0x1000"
    }
   ],
   "notes": [
    "T-GRE-8【D-GRE-2 §4】：S 位=0x1000；逐帧序号 0..8（gre.sequence 字段名以落盘 pcap 校准后回钉 distinct 断言）；min_packets=9 以 tshark 实测为准（探针 2026-09-15 九帧实锤）"
   ],
   "frames": [
    {
     "packet": 1,
     "offset": 34,
     "hex": "10 00 08 00"
    },
    {
     "packet": 1,
     "offset": 38,
     "hex": "00 00 00 00"
    },
    {
     "packet": 9,
     "offset": 38,
     "hex": "00 00 00 08"
    }
   ]
  }
 },
